# Analyses for "Blood-based biomarkers of Alzheimer’s disease and incident dementia in the community: a 16-year-long study"
# Objective: 1. To evaluate performance of combinations of biomarkers using cut-offs derived from the training set
# 2. Generate an ROC plot for the biomarker combinations
# R version 4.3.3
#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------#


